<BaseLayout title="Interior">
  <h1>Interior</h1>
  <p>This section covers the S60 cabin, seating, driver controls, storage, climate system, materials, and occupant safety. The dashboard architecture is characteristic of the third-generation S60, but upholstery, trim, seat functions, audio, displays, and convenience equipment vary by trim and option package.</p>
  <ReferencePhoto src="https://www.volvocars.com/media/support-content/img028459637a80b16dc0a801526df36585_1_--_--_VOICEpnghigh.png" variant="reference-diagram" alt="Volvo 2021 S60 Sensus cockpit support illustration showing the driver display, steering wheel and center touchscreen" caption="Volvo 2021 S60 Sensus-era cockpit reference. Display and optional equipment vary by vehicle; this is not a trim-specific equipment photograph." credit="Volvo Cars" source="https://www.volvocars.com/en-ca/support/car/s60/21w46/article/5b78d70bc7e244b1c0a81f6f7b69c865/5e799f698c111823c0a8cc723353898c/f6848b197ef39a36c0a80151207886f7/" license="Volvo Cars support illustration" />
  <h2>Explore the cabin</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="./seats-controls/">Seats and controls</a> — seat adjustment, memory, steering-wheel controls, mirrors, switches, and restraints.</li>
    <li><a href="../infotainment/">Infotainment and displays</a> — Sensus center display, driver display, audio, phone pairing, and supported connectivity.</li>
    <li><a href="../parts/#interior">Visual parts atlas: cabin</a> — jump to the illustrated cabin view.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Trim and equipment differences</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Momentum:</strong> equipment-focused baseline with available upgrades varying by market and package.</li>
    <li><strong>R-Design:</strong> sport-oriented seats, steering wheel, upholstery and decorative trim on applicable builds.</li>
    <li><strong>Inscription:</strong> comfort- and luxury-oriented seat, material and decorative details.</li>
    <li><strong>Recharge / Polestar Engineered:</strong> hybrid-specific displays or controls and performance-specific trim may be present.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Seat heating, ventilation, power adjustment, memory, rear-seat heating, steering-wheel heating, premium audio, navigation, head-up display and other features are option-dependent. Confirm what is installed in the individual car before following a control walkthrough or ordering a replacement component.</p>
  <div class="note"><strong>Safety:</strong> airbags, seat-belt pretensioners and their wiring are safety-critical. Do not probe SRS connectors or remove restraint components without the correct Volvo service procedure.</div>
</BaseLayout>
